Nx's official postmortem describes what happened and how Nx responded, and names the three weaknesses stage 01 sets out. Wiz's post covers the attack, and the page credits Wiz with the exposure and phase two counts. GitGuardian looks inside the credential leak, and StepSecurity reported the compromised Nx build system. The MITRE page defines T1567.001, the technique behind stage 06. The page attributes the 2,349 figure to The Hacker News without linking it.

As the page discloses, research published by Wiz is one of its sources, and the site's author works at Wiz.

The background slides name their own sources: the csoh.org GitHub Actions page and glossary, and MITRE ATT&CK.

